.superpowers/

# Compiled binaries. Go's cmd/<name>/ convention builds a binary named after
# its directory, so `go build ./...` inside cmd/dtl-lsp/ writes it in place.
# Add a line here for each new cmd/ binary.
/cmd/dtl-lsp/dtl-lsp

# `go test -bench` with a profile flag leaves the compiled test binary behind.
*.test

# Profiles from `go test -cpuprofile/-memprofile`.
*.prof
*.out
